{"id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md","title":"ZFC Linear Order","display":"df-zfc-linear-order — ZFC Linear Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-linear-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-linear-order","58-df-zfc-order6-linear-order","58-df-zfc-poset-linear-order"],"display":"df-zfc-linear-order — ZFC Linear Order","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-linear-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-linear-order</span><span>58-df-zfc-order6-linear-order</span><span>58-df-zfc-poset-linear-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-linear-order — ZFC Linear Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,L,R,\\leq\\in V\">\\(X,L,R,\\leq\\in V\\)</span> (carrier and relation parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\\)</span> (linear-order predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6LinearOrder}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLinearOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6LinearOrder}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLinearOrder}_S\\)</span> (compatibility aliases)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6LinearOrder}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(X,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6LinearOrder}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(X,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLinearOrder}_S(L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(L,\\leq)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLinearOrder}_S(L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(L,\\leq)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-order6-linear-order</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-poset-linear-order</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-partial-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,L,R,\\leq\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6LinearOrder}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLinearOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6LinearOrder}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(X,R)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLinearOrder}_S(L,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(L,\\leq)","display":true}],"bytes":1361,"backlinks":[{"id":"7b939b7524b2074c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-linear-order]]), $\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-sigma-algebra]]), and $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]])"},{"id":"2ca441732606436e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(L,\\leq_L)$ (linear-order predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]])"},{"id":"39adaf2272bb46e2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)$ (linear-order predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]])"},{"id":"4307c9ca1f88bad2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb I=\\langle I,R\\rangle$ is an encoded linear order and $\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,R)$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]])"},{"id":"1a4698440d79ae29","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcPosetOrderEmbedding}_S$ are the linear-order and order-embedding predicates (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]], [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding.md]])"},{"id":"20d69bde348c5967","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$, $\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S$, and $\\mathrm{Function}$ are the sigma-algebra, linear-order, and function predicates (see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]], [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]], [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])"},{"id":"e2db788b9ba8ebdc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S$ (linear-order predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]])"},{"id":"694fa3b59163804b","anchor":"ref-2","locations